        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-11-09T23:33:01.773Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, this was maybe the most fun I’ve ever had playing the Matriarch? In that I actually <em>had</em> fun, getting Reinforced Chassis and Intervening Path Calculator out so that, eventually, no one was taking damage except the Matriarch, who was being slowly eaten by the environment. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>VOD: <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/videos/1646546685\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Twitch</a></p>",
